      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 360 video of a place from one photo - MiniMax H3 + 360 LoRA\n\n## Models (in `ComfyUI/models/`)\n| File | Folder |\n|---|---|\n| minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors | `diffusion_models/` |\n| qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors | `text_encoders/` |\n| minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors, minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors | `vae/` |\n| [h3-360-equirect-lora-v1.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/rehan-fal/minimax-h3-360-equirect-lora/blob/main/h3-360-equirect-lora-v1.safetensors) | `loras/` |\n\nAny subfolder of `loras/` works: just select the file in the LoRA node.\n\n## Custom nodes (in `ComfyUI/custom_nodes/`)\n- **ComfyUI-KJNodes** (memory-efficient Sage attention patch for H3): https://github.com/kijai/ComfyUI-KJNodes\n\nRestart ComfyUI after installing.\n\n## Settings that matter (tested)\n- **fl2va** base, not ref2va: with ref2va the photo wins and the video is a normal wide shot, not a 360.\n- **2:1 size** (1024x512): 21:9 (the LoRA's training size) made the view turn and left a second seam with a photo.\n- **\"The view stays perfectly still...\"** sentence: without it the view can turn during the clip and the left/right seam drifts.\n- 360 LoRA at **0.75** (1.0 was not better). 20 steps. Results still depend on the seed: try another one if the back has a visible cut.\n- Turbo 8-step LoRA: about 2x faster but less reliable seam; enable the bypassed node and set steps to 8.\n\n## Text\nStart with what the photo shows, then what is straight ahead, right, behind, left and overhead, then the sound. End with a period.\nThe output is already 2:1: a 360 player can show it as an equirectangular video.\n"
      ],
